{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38420","headline":"三峰府内矮柏十韵 · 吴融","name":"三峰府内矮柏十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"擢秀依黄阁，移根自碧岑。\n周围虽合抱，直上岂盈寻。\n远砌行窥顶，当庭坐庇阴。\n短堪惊衆木，高已让他林。\n日转无长影，风回有细音。\n不容萝茑附，只耐雪霜侵。\n玉帐笼应匝，牙旗倚更禁。\n叶低宜拂席，枝褭易抽簪。\n绿涧支离久，朱门掩映深。\n何须一千丈，方有岁寒心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}